{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>And HaShem opened the mouth of the she-ass.</b> It appears that this too was a one-time necessity, to show him that he resembles this she-ass, whose nature is not to speak, and solely for Israel's honor did HaShem open its mouth; so too Balaam — only for the moment did HaShem open his mouth in prophecy, for Israel's honor. And so the nations should not say: had we had prophets, we would have returned to the better."], :book :numbers, :voice :kli-yakar, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:42:33.697847723Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}